stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Discovered
    Discovered --> Verified: Integrity and target
    Discovered --> Unavailable: Unsupported
    Verified --> AwaitingApproval: Approval missing
    AwaitingApproval --> Rejected: Approval declined
    AwaitingApproval --> Prepared: Approval recorded
    Verified --> Prepared: Trusted signed update
    Prepared --> Unavailable: Invalid candidate
    Prepared --> Quiescing: Gate admission
    Quiescing --> Prepared: Still busy
    Quiescing --> Committed: Atomic publication
    Committed --> Active: Matching process ready
    Committed --> RolledBack: Safe startup rollback
    Active --> Retiring: Disable or update
    Active --> Failed: Process failure
    Failed --> Committed: Bounded restart
    Failed --> Blocked: Recovery blocked
    Retiring --> Retired: Verified retirement
    Retired --> [*]: Eligible removal
